{"id":"wb-4-232","name":"广州大元帅府旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"孫中山大元帥府紀念館","text":"孙中山大元帅府纪念馆，位于中华人民共和国广东省广州市海珠区滨江街道中南社区纺织路东沙街18号，是以全国重点文物保护单位“广州大元帅府旧址”为依托建立的遗址性纪念馆。该处旧为孙中山于1917年兴建于此地的广东大元帅府。于2006年5月1日正式对外开放。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AD%AB%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%83%E5%B8%A5%E5%BA%9C%E7%B4%80%E5%BF%B5%E9%A4%A8","revisionId":95410858,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95410858","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e48f7e6b14a9ed34a3ebcafd.jpg","title":"The_Memorial_Museum_of_the_Generalissimo_Sun_Yat-sen's_Mansion_in_2017.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Memorial_Museum_of_the_Generalissimo_Sun_Yat-sen%27s_Mansion_in_2017.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/The_Memorial_Museum_of_the_Generalissimo_Sun_Yat-sen%27s_Mansion_in_2017.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nissangeniss","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​广州孫中山大元帥府紀念館","width":320,"height":213}}